  "notes": "Emaar The Economic City (ticker 4220) audited consolidated financial statements for the year ended 31 December 2025 with FY2024 comparatives, from the full audited PDF in the 'Annual / 2025' cell of the Saudi Exchange company-profile 'Financial Statements' tab (Resources/fsPdf/457_0_2026-04-08...). Auditor: KPMG Professional Services Company. The consolidated financial statements were approved and authorised for issue by the Board of Directors on 31 March 2026 (Note 40). Amounts are presented in thousands of Saudi Arabian Riyals (scale 1000). The primary statements (printed FS pages 7-12) are scanned images in the filed PDF (transcribed from page renders at 2.6x); the notes are digital text. Consolidated group; equity has no non-controlling interest line (equity = share capital + share premium + statutory reserve + accumulated profit), so only total_equity is carried. No discontinued operations. The FY2025 statements are prepared on a going-concern basis (Note): the Group made a near-breakeven net loss of SR 8.9m (FY2024: SR 1,134.6m loss) after refinancing SR 7.87bn of current loans into a SR 4.01bn non-current facility, recognising a SR 269.3m gain on extinguishment of financial liabilities and a SR 316.5m reversal of prior non-financial-asset impairments. impairment_charges combines the two P&L impairment lines - 'Impairment (loss)/reversal on financial and contract assets' and 'Impairment reversal on non-financial assets' - so a positive figure is a net reversal (SR +245.9m in FY2025). other_income combines 'Other operating income' and 'Amortization of unearned interest'. finance_income combines 'Financial income' and (FY2024) the 'Fair value gain on derivative financial liability'. finance_costs is 'Financial charges'. other_nonoperating_income is the 'Gain on extinguishment of financial liabilities' (FY2025 only). share_of_profit_associates is 'Share of loss of equity accounted investees' (a loss in both years). operating_income is the reported 'Operating profit / (loss)'. income_before_income_taxes_and_zakat is 'Profit / (loss) before zakat'; income_taxes_and_zakat is 'Zakat' - a charge in both years against a near-zero (FY2025) or negative (FY2024) pre-tax figure, so the effective-tax plausibility bound warns (expected). investment_property_value is 'Investment properties'; development_property_value combines the non-current and current 'Development properties'; contract_assets combines the non-current and current 'Contract assets and unbilled revenue'. other_noncurrent_assets combines the non-current 'Employees' receivable - home ownership scheme' and 'Restricted cash'; other_current_assets combines the current portions of those two lines. additional_paid_in_capital is 'Share premium' (nil at FY2024, before the FY2025 rights issue); other_reserves is the 'Statutory reserve'; retained_earnings is 'Accumulated profit'. long_term_debt is the non-current 'Loans and borrowings'; current_debt combines 'Loans and borrowings - current portion' and 'Short-term borrowings'. lease_liabilities_noncurrent / lease_liabilities_current are the non-current / current lease liabilities. other_noncurrent_liabilities is the non-current 'Zakat Liability' (a long-term zakat settlement); zakat_payable is the current 'Zakat provision'. contract_liabilities is 'Contract liabilities and unearned income'; provisions is 'Other provisions'. depreciation_amortization sums 'Depreciation on property and equipment', 'Depreciation on investment properties', 'Depreciation on right-of-use assets' and 'Amortization' from the cash-flow statement. capex is 'Additions to property and equipment'; interest_paid is 'Financial charges paid on loan and borrowings'; zakat_paid is 'Zakat paid'. Emaar EC pays no dividend. The cash-flow closing balance equals the balance-sheet 'Cash and cash equivalents' line exactly. Statement page references are the printed FS page numbers: profit or loss and OCI 7, financial position 8-9, cash flows 11-12.",
